// RA2 fixture: the arsenal of the small two sided world of the RA1 fixture (schema version 5),
// with the traits the rules of RA2 read. Defences (category "armory", the defence lane of the
// yards): the turret is powered and consumes power (as the Prism Tower), the sentry is powered
// and consumes none (as the Sentry Gun), the bunker is not powered (as the Pillbox); they may be
// placed within 4 free cells of a base building and are none themselves; the wall within 8, and
// it can be neither sold nor repaired. The storm device is a superweapon whose charge waits for
// power, and a player may have one; the vault two. The two radars are radar buildings and
// powered. The depot repairs vehicles. Every other building may be placed within 2 free cells
// of a base building. At schema version 4 (RA3) no unit has a trait of a unit: no infantry on
// foot and no crusher, so a cell holds one unit (docs/DECISIONS.md R6). Fixture data
// (invariant I10).
// At schema version 5 (RA4, docs/DECISIONS.md R46) no type has a trait of veterancy, crews,
// aircraft docks, spawning or cloaking.
